  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgX834U3XvyOdltNpcxlL3fALWPypDSimsB8TdU4G0De89lJpR1iWsLzEl9lrkqiHazcG5lPYsCi-t2oX5FVH2_ni4Uh6ZMjlugwqbsi17AfbkJ1XQyPeFbiQKBLresp1BEv2OcYHwBkGVQ/s2048/DSC07787%25E8%25AE%259A-1.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1366\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgX834U3XvyOdltNpcxlL3fALWPypDSimsB8TdU4G0De89lJpR1iWsLzEl9lrkqiHazcG5lPYsCi-t2oX5FVH2_ni4Uh6ZMjlugwqbsi17AfbkJ1XQyPeFbiQKBLresp1BEv2OcYHwBkGVQ/w640-h426/DSC07787%25E8%25AE%259A-1.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><b><br /></b><p></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">作品名稱</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">染布鳥飼囝</span></p><div><br /></div><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">作者簡介：</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">簡櫻汝，嘉義人。</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">高雄市五福國中輔導主任退休。出版《蓮花“滋”味》台語蓮花四句聯，開朗事業有限公司發行。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tuì學校退休了後，一直用台文寫面冊配家己hip ê野鳥、人文相片，恬恬仔tī hip鳥界推動台語文。</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hip相ê地點：</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">高雄市鳥松溼地</span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hip相片ê日期：</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">2012/04/21</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報327期，2021年6月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDElRVO1tB77tBmScrOjy5MtrfszTON5K9L_sWW_gPo05emGpvxQHYYB0LdT8Y_dGDmfXhlA0sFigcxxGgYzSm0TCUtzGJGWNg2FXgvtx1m18WrS8G2j6RCxyVK5gxIg0Tn8Rb34V68oKz/s1424/327%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDElRVO1tB77tBmScrOjy5MtrfszTON5K9L_sWW_gPo05emGpvxQHYYB0LdT8Y_dGDmfXhlA0sFigcxxGgYzSm0TCUtzGJGWNg2FXgvtx1m18WrS8G2j6RCxyVK5gxIg0Tn8Rb34V68oKz/w281-h400/327%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"281\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">（捐款than